# R-171: ALL03 opening logic-rate probe (59 Russian units + the White House
# hordes, the heaviest campaign opening). Run with --fps to get [perf] lines
# (fps = logic frames per wall second here: one fixed 1/15 s tick per frame):
#   ra2engine --play scripts/play/probe-perf-all03.play --out <dir> --fps
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL03U.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 1800
assert scene == game
end
